# Claude / AI settings (CLAUDE.md is intentionally tracked — it is the canonical shared agent guide)
# Note: these must exclude directory *contents* (`dir/*`), not the directory
# itself (`dir/`) — git will not descend into an excluded directory, so a `!`
# negation below it never takes effect.
.claude/*
# Shared, non-secret agent config every developer should get. Machine-local
# overrides stay in .claude/settings.local.json, which remains ignored.
!.claude/settings.json
# .serena/ is governed by its own .serena/.gitignore, which already excludes the
# LSP cache and project.local.yml while tracking project.yml — so a new developer
# gets the language/LSP config without running `serena project generate-yml`.
